1
00:00:00,540 --> 00:00:03,870
They took my battle ostrich!

2
00:00:03,870 --> 00:00:06,210
- Oh, no, not Glenn!
- Yes!

3
00:00:06,210 --> 00:00:07,540
(Sheldon:)Glenn!

4
00:00:07,540 --> 00:00:09,740
(Sheldon:)The only bird I ever loved.

5
00:00:11,250 --> 00:00:13,050
(Policeman:)Good luck, fellas.

6
00:00:13,050 --> 00:00:14,750
Oh. Well, thank you, officer.

7
00:00:14,750 --> 00:00:16,020
(Sheldon:)Wait a minute!

8
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:17,520
(Sheldon:)You're not going to do anything?

9
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:18,690
(Policeman:)Mr. Cooper,
there's nothing...

10
00:00:18,690 --> 00:00:20,190
(Policeman:)Dr. Cooper.

11
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:22,760
(Policeman:)Seriously?

12
00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:26,630
(Leonard:)Not the kind with
access to drugs.

13
00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:29,600
(Policeman:)Fine. Dr. Cooper.

14
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:31,030
(Policeman:)I'm sorry for your loss,

15
00:00:31,030 --> 00:00:32,570
(Policeman:)but the Pasadena
Police Department

16
00:00:32,570 --> 00:00:34,800
(Policeman:)doesn't have
jurisdiction in...

17
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:36,700
(Policeman:)Pandora.

18
00:00:36,710 --> 00:00:39,370
That's from Avatar!

19
00:00:40,680 --> 00:00:42,710
(Leonard:)World of Warcraft
takes place in Azeroth.

20
00:00:42,710 --> 00:00:45,580
(Sheldon:)Goodness gracious, how are you
allowed to carry a gun?

21
00:00:46,680 --> 00:00:50,720
(Sheldon:)Can you at least refer me
to a rogue ex-cop?

22
00:00:50,720 --> 00:00:52,050
(Policeman:)What?

23
00:00:52,050 --> 00:00:54,860
Wh-- you know, one who was
drummed off the force

24
00:00:54,860 --> 00:00:56,690
(Sheldon:)because he refused
to play by the rules,

25
00:00:56,690 --> 00:00:58,390
(Sheldon:)and now he hires himself out

26
00:00:58,390 --> 00:01:02,020
(Sheldon:)to impose his own brand
of rough justice?

